  <DMS_Chelydridae_MainBattleTank_Miho_Faction_Supremacist_NEO_NPC.description>The ultimate weapon upon which the survival of the fluffies depends. It was designed to counter the increasingly brutal warfare in the surrounding region. Once, this technology was merely the product of compromises and postponements. But when a powerful enemy faction became wealthy enough to grow reclusive, they seized the opportunity to steal its resources. By forcibly solving the energy problem, the project finally saw the light of day. There is a drink bar inside.</DMS_Chelydridae_MainBattleTank_Miho_Faction_Supremacist_NEO_NPC.description>
